      ],
      "en": "“Where is he who is born King of the Jews? For we saw his star in the east, and have come to worship him.”",
      "ko": "유대인의 왕으로 나신 이가 어디 계시뇨 우리가 동방에서 그의 별을 보고 그에게 경배하러 왔노라 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "87b5b934da95da1e4563170fda70443f8d18e7fad33d906d4e81b6a9f4bc2641",
      "translation_text_hash": "5385bb0dd9c72c86191c4993e245dc6e6bef95d1519dd951df0ff64df005e0d5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
