      "en": "They said to him, “In Bethlehem of Judea, for this is written through the prophet,",
      "ko": "가로되 유대 베들레헴이오니 이는 선지자로 이렇게 기록된바",
      "source_text_hash": "1eedacc1c7f7844c740896ebcf9444f47c0d4d6a22c71f797367765fe20a5ba6",
      "translation_text_hash": "ee6db93c5ba98e6cfa6e7a156a82c8eedb519ee7c2e622c98380c0bfa0d96e68",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
