      "en": "Then Herod secretly called the wise men, and learned from them exactly what time the star appeared.",
      "ko": "이에 헤롯이 가만히 박사들을 불러 별이 나타난 때를 자세히 묻고",
      "source_text_hash": "f935fc6ad7aa891ca8514bb5233bac48d6f2e2fa93e43921f485e0887817ea9f",
      "translation_text_hash": "c0fd17eaf32409231b2d4c400e93e925b302b765596802d38daa7eead096602c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이에 헤롯이 가만히 박사들을 불러 별이 나타난 때를 자세히 묻고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c0fd17eaf32409231b2d4c400e93e925b302b765596802d38daa7eead096602c"
      ]
    },
    {
