      "en": "They, having heard the king, went their way; and behold, the star, which they saw in the east, went before them until it came and stood over where the young child was.",
      "ko": "박사들이 왕의 말을 듣고 갈쌔 동방에서 보던 그 별이 문득 앞서 인도하여 가다가 아기 있는 곳 위에 머물러 섰는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "f9820e7a454ddefc96443ce63c582f0fb99da6d4cb9ab110b1f7f97ca51c5082",
      "translation_text_hash": "1e4cfa48380f5ab85d147e4a98d2c3c9180d53603a467e9f61c47579974808b8",
