      "en": "Being warned in a dream not to return to Herod, they went back to their own country another way.",
      "ko": "꿈에 헤롯에게로 돌아가지 말라 지시하심을 받아 다른 길로 고국에 돌아가니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2b38f39682517f7f198a1ac560934f13e63542a1ef51975d1689884ed07c63a5",
      "translation_text_hash": "7a5bd17eb6efab7fd05fffe5eff2851cb227b1097f7505f8ade01b6a6d1ad813",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
